Here is the base code for a central HVAC chiller plant in Siemens SCL.

```pascal
FUNCTION_BLOCK "ChillerPlant_Base"
VAR_INPUT
    Enable : Bool;
    OAT : Real; // Outside Air Temp
    CHW_Supply : Real; // Chilled Water Supply Temp
    CHW_Setpoint : Real;
END_VAR
VAR_OUTPUT
    Chiller1_Run : Bool;
    Chiller2_Run : Bool;
    CWT_Setpoint : Real; // Condenser Water Temp Setpoint
END_VAR
VAR
    LeadChiller : Int := 1;
END_VAR
BEGIN
    // CWT Reset Algorithm for Energy Optimization
    IF OAT < 15.0 THEN
        CWT_Setpoint := 22.0;
    ELSIF OAT > 30.0 THEN
        CWT_Setpoint := 29.0;
    ELSE
        CWT_Setpoint := 22.0 + (OAT - 15.0) * (7.0 / 15.0);
    END_IF;

    // Lead/Lag Staging
    IF Enable THEN
        IF CHW_Supply > (CHW_Setpoint + 1.5) THEN
            Chiller1_Run := TRUE;
            Chiller2_Run := TRUE;
        ELSE
            Chiller1_Run := (LeadChiller = 1);
            Chiller2_Run := (LeadChiller = 2);
        END_IF;
    ELSE
        Chiller1_Run := FALSE;
        Chiller2_Run := FALSE;
    END_IF;
END_FUNCTION_BLOCK
```

